.TH grex-import 1  "grex-import "
.SH NAME
grex\-import \- Import a legacy flat `REPOS.json` array. v1.4.1: every accepted entry is materialized as both an `Event::Add` row in `.grex/events.jsonl` AND a `children:` entry in `.grex/pack.yaml`. Optional `platform:` keys (cfg\-style `cmn`/`win`/`lnx`/`mac` buckets) compose into `<platform>/<path>` so the source metarepo\*(Aqs on\-disk layout survives the migration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgrex\-import\fR [\fB\-\-from\-repos\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-manifest\fR] [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Import a legacy flat `REPOS.json` array. v1.4.1: every accepted entry is materialized as both an `Event::Add` row in `.grex/events.jsonl` AND a `children:` entry in `.grex/pack.yaml`. Optional `platform:` keys (cfg\-style `cmn`/`win`/`lnx`/`mac` buckets) compose into `<platform>/<path>` so the source metarepo\*(Aqs on\-disk layout survives the migration
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-from\-repos\-json\fR \fI<FROM_REPOS_JSON>\fR
Path to a legacy REPOS.json file
.TP
\fB\-\-manifest\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Target event log (`.grex/events.jsonl`). Defaults to `<workspace>/.grex/events.jsonl` where `<workspace>` is resolved by walking up from cwd to the nearest `.grex/` marker
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Verb\-scoped dry\-run. Alias for the global `\-\-dry\-run`; either flag short\-circuits before any manifest write
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
